    {
      "id": "claim_c5b972e3c1c5482194528c3d784312af",
      "statement": "Orders in pending, reserved, or payment_unknown states block automatic replay because the existing row collides with the INSERT ON CONFLICT guard. A replay against any of these states returns the latest persisted record with httpStatus 409, requiring operator reconciliation rather than blind retry.",
